WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.210
Lunch break.

2
00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:05.590
Your friend types their password,
and you happen to see every key.

3
00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:08.270
That evening, you log in to their account.

4
00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:12.010
You read a few messages,
change nothing, and log out.

5
00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:15.530
Now rewind to the moment
before you tapped Log in.

6
00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:16.950
No files damaged.

7
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.350
No money taken.

8
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.510
So have you broken the law?

9
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:25.150
In this mission, you'll meet the law that
makes some misuse of computers a crime,

10
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.510
and see how its offences
step up in seriousness.

11
00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:32.390
You'll find out how laws control
the way organisations collect,

12
00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.950
store and use your personal data.

13
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.190
And you'll learn your rights over the
data organisations hold about you.

14
00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:43.520
Your mission: decide whether
logging in just to look is a crime.
